window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A time travel tale. A slow burning love story. An ingenious exploration of what it means to be human.</p> <p>This first thrilling installment of the award-winning Heartless Trilogy will delight lovers of sci-fi, time travel, and romantic adventures. It’s perfect for fans of Becky Chambers, Hugh Howey, Naomi Alderman, and Kaliane Bradley.</p> <p>Earth: 2049. Scientist and BASE jump enthusiast Quinn Buyers would rather be studying clouds than getting ready for her wedding. When a devastating climate tragedy strikes, she makes a narrow escape, only to be held responsible for the catastrophe. With powerful enemies threatening everything she holds dear, including her famous scientist mother, she embarks on a dangerous quest for answers that takes her across the globe.</p> <p>On her journey, she assembles an unlikely crew of allies, including a clever AI meerkat and a fierce, quick-witted guerrilla fighter. But her travels through wondrous metropolises and ‘cool reef’ climate cities reveal a deceptive reality. With allies turning into traitors and the Transhumans lurking in the background, can her unique set of combat skills save her?</p> <p>As the stakes heighten, her undeniable attraction to a mysterious cyborg, who holds secrets about her past, heats up.</p> <p>Set in the not-too-distant future, <i>Gravity Is Heartless</i> offers a thought-provoking look at love, loss, and the resilience of the human spirit facing climate catastrophe.</p>"; 
